---
layout: base.njk
title: "Website Guides for Small Businesses"
description: "Practical website guides for UK small businesses, covering SEO, performance, website planning and choosing the right service model."
date: 2026-02-01
---

<section class="plan-hero bg-bg-primary dark:bg-bg-primary-dark">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="plan-hero__grid">
            <div class="hero-entry">
                <p class="eyebrow">Website advice, without the jargon</p>
                <h1>Make better decisions about your website</h1>
                <p class="plan-hero__lead">Straightforward guides for small-business owners who want to understand what makes a website useful, visible and worth investing in.</p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mt-8">
                    <a href="#latest-guides" class="btn btn--primary btn-shine justify-center">Read the latest guides</a>
                    <a href="/website-review/" class="btn btn--secondary justify-center">Get a free website review</a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-entry hero-entry--delay flex items-center justify-center" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="w-full max-w-md min-w-0">
                    {% image "./src/img/resources.svg", "", [400, 800], "w-full h-auto max-w-full" %}
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-padding bg-bg-section dark:bg-bg-section-dark">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-intro">
            <p class="eyebrow">What you will find here</p>
            <h2>Useful context before you spend money</h2>
            <p>I write about the decisions that most often affect website results: what to build, how to improve it and where common advice needs a little more nuance.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <article class="plan-scope-card">
                <h3>Planning and investment</h3>
                <p>Understand different website models, realistic costs and how to choose the right scope for your business.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="plan-scope-card">
                <h3>Search and content</h3>
                <p>Learn the SEO foundations that help the right people find your website and understand what you offer.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="plan-scope-card">
                <h3>Speed and reliability</h3>
                <p>See why performance matters, what commonly slows websites down and which improvements are worth prioritising.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="latest-guides" class="section-padding-lg bg-bg-primary dark:bg-bg-primary-dark scroll-mt-24">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-intro">
            <p class="eyebrow">Latest resources</p>
            <h2>Practical website guides</h2>
            <p>Each article is written to help you make a clearer decision or take a useful next step.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
            {% for post in collections.posts %}
            <article class="reveal bg-bg-surface dark:bg-bg-surface-dark rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-border-standard dark:border-border-standard-dark overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
                <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="block h-full focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-brand-primary">
                    {% if post.data.image %}
                    <div class="aspect-video bg-bg-card dark:bg-bg-card-dark overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" width="800" height="450">
                    </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    <div class="p-6 md:p-7">
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4 text-sm">
                            {% if post.data.category %}<span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 font-semibold text-text-primary dark:text-brand-primary bg-brand-light rounded-full">{{ post.data.category }}</span>{% endif %}
                            <time datetime="{{ post.data.date | htmlDateString }}" class="text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</time>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-3 text-text-primary dark:text-text-strong-dark leading-tight">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
                        {% if post.data.excerpt %}<p class="text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed mb-5">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>{% endif %}
                        <span class="text-link">Read guide <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-padding bg-bg-section dark:bg-bg-section-dark">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="ownership-panel reveal">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">Need advice about your own site?</p>
                <h2>Get a useful starting point</h2>
                <p>Articles can explain the principles, but your website has its own audience, constraints and priorities. I can review it and point out the clearest opportunities.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ownership-panel__aside">
                <h3>Free website review</h3>
                <ul class="check-list">
                    <li>Personal feedback within 48 hours</li>
                    <li>Clear, prioritised observations</li>
                    <li>No obligation to buy anything</li>
                </ul>
                <a href="/website-review/" class="btn btn--primary btn-shine justify-center w-full">Request your review</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": "Website Guides for Small Businesses",
  "description": "Practical website guides for UK small businesses covering SEO, performance and website planning.",
  "url": "https://codecraftnorth.co.uk/resources/"
}
</script>
